# The repository is LF, in the working tree as well as in the object store.
# Git for Windows defaults core.autocrlf to true, so without this the
# Windows leg of the matrix checks out CRLF copies of the fixtures that
# assert on exact tree bytes, and then fails on content it never wrote.
# The tool takes the same position about the repositories it writes, where
# it sets core.autocrlf=false and core.eol=lf.
* text=auto eol=lf
